### Normalized scores (1–100)

**Not assigned.** No verified exact-model quality benchmark was found, so no dimension scores or Overall are fabricated. The documented preview and pricing remain useful access facts, not substitutes for measured task performance.

Fresh exact-name Bing RSS search exposed no result items; the configured search integration returned HTTP 402 earlier in the run. Direct official documentation, public catalog filtering, publisher registry search, and the exact tracker profile were inspected. These limitations support a bounded no-evidence conclusion, not a claim that the model does not exist.

